<title>CHINA: Wing Sung 1996 net down 36.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing Sung 1996 net down 36.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	   226.52	vs	  212.04</p>
<p> Net profit	  13.89	vs	   21.97</p>
<p> Net asset per share    3.08  yuan    vs   3.23 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.124 yuan   vs   0.226 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Wing Sung Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement.</p>
<p>All figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accountings standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed to offer a 1.5-for-10 bonus issue for all shareholders pending approval of a shareholders meeting, the statement said.</p>
</text>
